    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasin Asa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu guroorooda ASEETA heeda Asariya was orjeeda Odedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gawa jarooda gwaroonyi Asa, ak gwayeesha, “Aleeysean iita, ea Asa, sea fuga sean bea Yuda ea Benjamini. NG'UTAMIIDA gwandeayi sea agooga, nea eara agooga goondeayi sea niny. Nea iyoogaseadi niny, gajanyasa, ama inyas gajajakta niny, abeeda eara niny gaygwajaktaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga Israeli gweanyeeka saang'a mandeawana ASEETA huumwa, nea mandeawana ashoohoocheanda anealshachi, nea ea mandeawana deaweeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean nea gwanda jeeda hang'weanidooda gwayamsa geat NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli, aba ng'ata gagaseada niny, ak hean ghwanyas saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda aba damanyoojigiga ea manda hoyyoo aba gilinyoo gwarita jarooda ghana gilinyoo ghwahidu jih, aba gideaba sawanadeeda haw goobissa fuga bea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geehirjeaweada ea ghoah basanga ng'eanyiida ea ng'eanyiida, ea mujiini ea mujiini, aba gideaba gooyuuk saawa ASEETA aba gilinyoo ea sawanaduutka gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga ea adiidu ghoabeali adiidu ghabealbeal geatingeagwa, aba gideaba gadiyeedeang'wa gaygwanda giimearda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Asa ng'asheesu, was ramooranga Asariya was orjeeda Odediin, ghwanyas uurda, ng'ata gageanda haleanjeeda munyas aba jeeda ng'eanyoojiga sean bea Yuda ea Benjamini ea mujiinajeega ghayi nigeanda bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, aba ng'ata ghwadeas heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA mida madeeda doodooda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwada geat fuga sean bea Yuda ea Benjamini, ea gea leabu Efraimu, ea Manase, ea Simeoni was bareanoodiga sea saawa, aba gideaba gaweesa headaanyi fuga saang'a iitooda nyaawa leabu Israeli iinea ghwadaah gideaba nidaah gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI gwandeayi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwat geat aba Yerusalemu sheedeaba samwagu bea sheedeaba damanamuut bea gheambalmeeda Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA lukghumajeega aba eaweedida, bea haleanjeeda ghayi aas was heew bughalaji ispwa ea gisil sagalamnyooji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin neajeeda bea gideaba gaygagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, aba gurooruunatka nyaawa, ea aba jeesinga nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gideaba gilinyoo ea magaseada NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, gajeenung' gameewa, eara ea woosi, ada ea ng'eedeeda gil, ghanea gatmooda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweaksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda aba giijuureanda ea aba nyeashta, ea aba durumbeatajeega, ea aba gujaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosasa Yuda habeawooda aba gideaba ghwaak habeawooda aba gurooruunatka nyaawa, nea nigaseada niny aba bariinyeega nyaawa, ak niny ea nidaah saawa, ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA saawa fuufta aba meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara Maakaheeda was gheamata sugoocheanda was Asa geegeandeawa hoorgeeda waseewa gheamata sugoocheanda aba gideaba gwasin sanaamu. Hean ghwalajaada Asa sanaamoadaanyi, ama ng'ata gagul ak gwajaksa jeeda eenda Gidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heetiyeada ea meegeanda aba jeeda Israeli. Nea guroorooda Asa ea meeyaagana ghoorjooda aba eawoojigaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweadu jeeda gheeda ASEETA haleanjeeda ghayi aghaydiit ghwaan ea gea aghaydiit niny, was lapiya, ea dahaabu ea dabita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada ng'ucheeda bwak ea gagul gweaydeaba diktam ea damanamuut bea gheambalmeeda Asa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
